{% extends "doc_page.jinja" %}
{% import "chrome.jinja" as chrome %}
{% import "forthcoming_data.jinja" as fc %}
{% set active_nav = 'roadmap' %}
{% block page_title %}Roadmap - Netsuke Build System{% endblock %}

{#
  The shipped list and the road ahead are data, rendered by the loops
  below, so a card's shape is written once.

  `shipped` groups: each item is trusted HTML, and `new` marks what this
  release added; move those flags when the release changes.

  `tracks`: each capability track names its upstream roadmap `source`, an
  optional `preview` key from forthcoming_data.jinja, and its items. An
  item's `section` is an anchor on that preview page, and `fc.href` fails
  the build if the anchor is not one the preview declares; `task` is the
  upstream roadmap step and its GitHub anchor. `done` ticks the item.
#}
